doctor.json: a real `doctor --json` of a fresh tree on a Mac. doctor-blocked.json: doctor.json edited by hand (the makensis line and the windows and macos blockers) for a Mac where Homebrew lacks sdl3, libepoxy and makensis.
package-heartbeat.txt: written by hand from the plain-mode heartbeat format of package/progress.py (View.heartbeat), around a recomp step.
